{"id":"npc:%E7%B1%B3%E8%8E%8E","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"乌萨斯人，感染者，碎骨的姐姐。其父谢尔盖曾与凯尔希为研究石棺共事过，谢尔盖在临死前将切尔诺伯格的秘钥交给了她，因而进入龙门后被龙门近卫局与整合运动追缉。在贫民窟被罗德岛发现并准备送往近卫局，但在送达后被W截走。见到阿米娅击杀碎骨后选择加入整合运动，又被W的话语所刺激，穿上了碎骨的装备与阿米娅一行人战斗，最终阵亡。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情2-3 无罪推定、3-5 呼叫等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_char_012_misa_1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/0/05/Avg_char_012_misa_1.png/240px-Avg_char_012_misa_1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-03_beg","lineCount":2,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":15,"line":16,"speaker":"米莎","text":"真乖。"},{"commandIndex":17,"line":18,"speaker":"米莎","text":"藏好！别出声。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-03_end","lineCount":30,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":5,"line":6,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……呼。"},{"commandIndex":45,"line":46,"speaker":"米莎","text":"走开！我的爪子很锋利的……！不想受伤的话……"},{"commandIndex":96,"line":97,"speaker":"米莎","text":"毕竟，我没什么选择，是吗？"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-04_end","lineCount":10,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":9,"line":10,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……哈……究竟是什么人……啊……"},{"commandIndex":63,"line":64,"speaker":"米莎","text":"但我知道近卫局，也看到过近卫局怎么对待感染者。如果你们真的只是想抓我的话，直说不就行了。"},{"commandIndex":71,"line":72,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-05_beg","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":92,"line":93,"speaker":"米莎","text":"啊……你是……"},{"commandIndex":99,"line":100,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":105,"line":106,"speaker":"米莎","text":"你是……？！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-05_end","lineCount":7,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":9,"line":10,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……怎么……会……"},{"commandIndex":24,"line":25,"speaker":"米莎","text":"为什么感染者之间要……"},{"commandIndex":106,"line":107,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-06_end","lineCount":11,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":17,"line":18,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……我们……安全了吗？"},{"commandIndex":33,"line":34,"speaker":"米莎","text":"我不知道发生了什么……大家都开始跑……我也……"},{"commandIndex":44,"line":45,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-07_beg","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":5,"line":6,"speaker":"米莎","text":"呜唔……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-07_end","lineCount":10,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":40,"line":41,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……我相信。"},{"commandIndex":49,"line":50,"speaker":"米莎","text":"整合运动……还会追上来吧？"},{"commandIndex":63,"line":64,"speaker":"米莎","text":"该我……感谢你。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-08_beg","lineCount":8,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":8,"line":9,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":54,"line":55,"speaker":"米莎","text":"阿米娅，我不在这段时间里，请你保护贫民区的孩子们。"},{"commandIndex":66,"line":67,"speaker":"米莎","text":"嗯，好。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-09_end","lineCount":13,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":51,"line":52,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……长官。"},{"commandIndex":77,"line":78,"speaker":"米莎","text":"我想不出自己有什么值得你们追缉的理由。"},{"commandIndex":80,"line":81,"speaker":"米莎","text":"——我的父亲身上。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_03-02_end","lineCount":33,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":7,"line":8,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":134,"line":135,"speaker":"米莎","text":"我也遇到过别的帮助感染者的人……他们……"},{"commandIndex":165,"line":166,"speaker":"米莎","text":"————碎骨……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_03-03_end","lineCount":14,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":5,"line":6,"speaker":"米莎","text":"嗯……"},{"commandIndex":52,"line":53,"speaker":"米莎","text":"他们，他们一定会帮助感染者的。"},{"commandIndex":93,"line":94,"speaker":"米莎","text":"……嗯。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_03-04_end","lineCount":2,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":150,"line":151,"speaker":"米莎","text":"…………"},{"commandIndex":152,"line":153,"speaker":"米莎","text":"不…………不要…………"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_03-05_end","lineCount":50,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":79,"line":80,"speaker":"米莎","text":"你是……"},{"commandIndex":155,"line":156,"speaker":"米莎","text":"你说得对，阿米娅，你说得对……我只是愧疚而已。我只是……太过软弱了而已。"},{"commandIndex":161,"line":162,"speaker":"米莎","text":"再见了……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_03-06_end","lineCount":25,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":31,"line":32,"speaker":"米莎","text":"毕竟我还有利用价值，是吗？"},{"commandIndex":102,"line":103,"speaker":"米莎","text":"如果是他，他一定会保护大家……保护所有人。"},{"commandIndex":116,"line":117,"speaker":"米莎","text":"我必须……"}]}]}